WEBVTT

00:00:08.010 --> 00:00:09.970
<i>Today I start leadership training!</i>

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:13.650
<i>It's an overnight workshop 
for all of the school's new</i>

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:16.620
<i>class and event representatives!</i>

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:29.340
<b>Tanaka</b>

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:32.600
Asleep? Is he sleeping in?!

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:35.220
Hey, Kou! Wake up!

00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:38.480
Did he wake up and go back to sleep?

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:41.470
I went out of my way to 
call you and wake you up, so—

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:46.690
You're awfully tenacious...

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.230
Oh, no!

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:52.250
Why are you naked?!

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:55.540
Oh, no! No!

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:13.630
Th-Th-This isn't the reason 
I came here, okay?!

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:16.800
Huh? You idiot...

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:21.030
You think I'm throwing myself at you?

00:01:21.030 --> 00:01:23.450
You kept screaming. 
It was bothering the neighbors.

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:25.510
B-But you're naked!

00:01:25.510 --> 00:01:27.730
I was about to take a shower.

00:01:29.580 --> 00:01:33.340
<i>I jumped to the wrong conclusion.
 So embarrassing!</i>

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:36.460
A shower? Now?

00:01:36.460 --> 00:01:38.830
We don't have time for that!

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:40.450
It's fine.

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:41.980
Come in and wait.

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:43.910
Don't be so relaxed!

00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:46.330
That hurt.

00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:53.540
<i>Kou's bare skin. I touched it...</i>

00:01:53.540 --> 00:01:57.100
<i>A-And it was so smooth...</i>

00:01:58.250 --> 00:02:01.100
<i>Aren't you a little too fussy with your skin?</i>

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:14.660
<i>Huh? It's so neat and tidy...</i>

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:26.200
Youichi Age 4
Kou Age 4
Kou Age 3
Youichi Age 3

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:29.800
I'm ready.

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:31.820
R-Right!

00:02:32.430 --> 00:02:33.880
But you got ready really fast!

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:36.840
<b>Cooking</b>

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:35.310
Let's go.

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:40.300
Shuuei Line - Sakigatani Station

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:43.640
See? We made it in time, without rushing.

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:46.540
Just barely, though.

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:51.520
<b>Kanagawa Shuuei Line</b>

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:48.990
At times like this, you want 
a little more leeway, just in case...

00:02:48.990 --> 00:02:49.610
Oh.

00:02:49.610 --> 00:02:50.220
What is it?

00:02:53.760 --> 00:02:56.050
I can't believe you forgot 
your bag at my house!

00:02:56.050 --> 00:02:57.280
Sorry!

00:02:57.890 --> 00:03:00.690
What's wrong with you, Kou?! Run faster!

00:03:00.690 --> 00:03:03.030
You're the one who made me carry your bag!

00:03:08.510 --> 00:03:10.000
The train's here!

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:12.790
We can't make it. 
Let's wait for the next one.

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:16.370
Don't you dare give up!

00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:21.660
We made it!

00:03:22.940 --> 00:03:25.670
Um... the meeting place is...

00:03:26.590 --> 00:03:30.740
I think... Osakigaoka Station...

00:03:30.740 --> 00:03:32.780
Isn't Osakigaoka in the other direction?

00:03:35.670 --> 00:03:40.320
Oh, no! I accidentally got on 
the usual train to school!

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:43.910
And this is an express. 
It won't be stopping for a while.

00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:49.120
I'm sorry, Yuuri!

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:52.580
Hello, Futaba-chan? Where are you?

00:03:53.030 --> 00:03:56.590
I'm sorry! I guess you've 
all met up already, right?

00:03:56.930 --> 00:03:59.080
Tanaka-sensei.

00:03:57.310 --> 00:03:59.080
Yeah. Yeah.

00:03:59.080 --> 00:04:01.220
I know it's useless to say it to you,

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:04.500
but they've got to shape up!

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:06.510
I'm sorry! Really sorry!

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:08.470
We can't wait any longer!

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:11.300
Have them look at the map and 
find the site themselves!

00:04:11.300 --> 00:04:14.170
D-Did you hear that?

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:13.100
Sorry...

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:14.980
<i>Yeah...</i>

00:04:18.420 --> 00:04:21.870
I'm already exhausted.

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:23.970
That's my line.

00:04:27.570 --> 00:04:29.150
Kou, you can sleep if you want.

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:31.580
Huh... you mean it?

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:34.980
Yeah. I'll wake you when we get there.

00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:37.300
If you would, thanks.

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:44.010
Guh. I really can't believe it.

00:06:14.460 --> 00:06:16.410
You people...

00:06:16.410 --> 00:06:18.390
Promise this will never happen again!

00:06:18.950 --> 00:06:19.720
Yes, sir.

00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:20.560
Yes, sir.

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:24.370
Now get changed and get to lunch!

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:26.490
I'm very sorry.

00:06:37.190 --> 00:06:38.800
Darn it.

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:41.530
You know, it's really embarrassing for us

00:06:41.530 --> 00:06:44.750
to have both class representatives arrive late.

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:47.530
Yeah... I'm sorry.

00:06:49.030 --> 00:06:49.820
Kou.

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:54.130
They want you to compose a 
written apology for being late.

00:06:54.130 --> 00:06:57.130
Hand it in before lights out.

00:06:57.130 --> 00:06:58.310
What?

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:00.570
You, too, Yoshioka.

00:07:00.570 --> 00:07:02.250
Right...

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:08.710
Jeez... apology for what?

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:12.410
Mabuchi-kun, when you cause trouble,

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:14.980
it makes trouble for Tanaka-sensei, too.

00:07:14.980 --> 00:07:17.300
I think you should be more careful.

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:20.530
Oh, don't worry about him.

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:24.460
I am who I am. It doesn't have 
anything to do with my brother.

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:28.630
So you made someone totally unrelated 
to the incident apologize for you?

00:07:29.190 --> 00:07:30.040
You brat.

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:33.470
No...

00:07:33.790 --> 00:07:35.150
Rotten brat.

00:07:38.670 --> 00:07:40.250
Murao-san...

00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:42.260
Th-That reminds me!

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:46.060
I was sure surprised when you offered 
to be an event representative, Murao-san!

00:07:46.060 --> 00:07:47.770
You like this kind of thing?

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:49.110
Not especially.

00:07:50.050 --> 00:07:52.320
<i>Then why did you volunteer?!</i>

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:57.640
It sure is rich to see someone so 
uncooperative lecturing others.

00:07:58.300 --> 00:07:59.120
Hey!

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:03.120
You shouldn't talk to girls that way.

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:07.130
The vibe's getting really bad here, you guys!

00:08:07.130 --> 00:08:08.170
I'm done.

00:08:09.870 --> 00:08:11.160
I'm done.

00:08:11.160 --> 00:08:12.260
What?

00:08:12.570 --> 00:08:14.560
<i>What's going on here?</i>

00:08:16.540 --> 00:08:18.740
Futaba-chan! Let's do our best, okay?

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:20.680
Yuuri...

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:24.950
<i>Thank goodness! At least 
Yuuri is a sweet girl.</i>

00:08:24.950 --> 00:08:26.400
I'm done.

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:28.330
I am finished, too!

00:08:28.330 --> 00:08:30.320
If you're not gonna eat that, I will.

00:08:31.850 --> 00:08:35.680
I left it especially so 
I could eat it later...

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:42.580
That guy... do you think 
I'll let this insult stand?!

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:43.770
Who are you?!

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:52.130
So, anyone have any opinions?

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:53.060
Murao-san?

00:08:53.060 --> 00:08:54.090
Nothing in particular.

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:55.160
Yuuri?

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:56.930
Um...

00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:58.510
Kominato-kun?

00:08:57.310 --> 00:09:00.890
Oh, so tomorrow's orienteering?

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:02.850
Kou...

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:06.690
<b>LAWLESS</b>

00:09:03.360 --> 00:09:06.690
<b>ZONE</b>

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:06.690
<i>These people, seriously!</i>

00:09:07.110 --> 00:09:09.110
Come on, give your opinions!

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:12.340
The question is "What's the 
purpose of school events?"

00:09:12.340 --> 00:09:15.780
We have to do this! We might get 
picked to read ours aloud!

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:18.280
Just write whatever.

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:30.220
What class shall I pick, eh? Let's see...

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:32.580
Okay, class 2-2.

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:35.330
U-Um...

00:09:35.820 --> 00:09:37.300
Futaba-chan...

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:41.310
You wrote something, right? 
I'll just read that.

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:47.390
<b>Happy memories!</b>

00:09:47.390 --> 00:09:49.930
What's wrong? Get to it.

00:09:47.390 --> 00:09:54.610
<b>Leadership Training

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:52.410
Okay.

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:57.640
Um... the purpose of school events.

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:02.520
By setting targets and goals that 
can only be achieved by a group,

00:10:02.520 --> 00:10:04.990
you foster a feeling of 
belonging to that group.

00:10:04.990 --> 00:10:10.720
By doing this, you get everyone 
to share a sense of commonality,

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:10.430
<i>Incredible!</i>

00:10:10.430 --> 00:10:14.250
<i>He can recite things he doesn't even believe 
so smoothly off the top of his head...</i>

00:10:10.720 --> 00:10:14.250
and in that way, bring them 
together. Or something.

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:18.760
Not bad. Okay, next...

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:20.110
Wait a minute.

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:24.010
I'm not sure I fully understood that.

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:27.640
So annoying...

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:31.590
Why is it important to bring people together?

00:10:31.590 --> 00:10:34.380
Huh? Because, you know...

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:41.370
There are things you can 
only achieve together.

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:44.330
<b>Happy memories!</b>

00:10:50.570 --> 00:10:51.890
Kou?

00:10:53.700 --> 00:10:55.070
So that...

00:10:56.380 --> 00:10:58.400
So that someday, when you look back,

00:10:58.400 --> 00:11:02.460
the people you experienced it with 
will see it as a "happy memory"

00:11:02.460 --> 00:11:05.170
with the same warmth that you do.

00:11:07.580 --> 00:11:09.380
That's nice, too.

00:11:09.380 --> 00:11:11.560
Okay, you can sit down.

00:11:14.350 --> 00:11:19.240
Why do you look so shocked? 
You're the one that wrote it.

00:11:40.960 --> 00:11:42.340
Yoshioka.

00:11:42.790 --> 00:11:44.750
Did you write your apology?

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:52.270
You haven't written anything yet. 
You can just write whatever, you know.

00:11:53.930 --> 00:11:56.620
You really are incredible, Kou.

00:11:56.620 --> 00:11:57.370
How so?

00:11:57.830 --> 00:12:03.230
You just rattled it off so easily... 
while I'm struggling so hard...

00:12:04.580 --> 00:12:07.530
I end up spinning my wheels 
and it just backfires...

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:11.380
I wish I could be more like you.

00:12:12.380 --> 00:12:16.080
Why can't I do it? It's so frustrating.

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:23.270
You shouldn't feel frustrated.

00:12:25.420 --> 00:12:28.630
It's not easy for me. I'm just half-baked.

00:12:29.420 --> 00:12:33.480
Maybe it looks easy for me 
because I don't care.

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:38.510
The fact that it makes 
you depressed to do that

00:12:39.260 --> 00:12:42.090
is proof that you 
want to do something.

00:12:49.260 --> 00:12:50.040
So...

00:13:00.860 --> 00:13:05.880
S-So... I think you're a lot 
more respectable than I am.

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:10.670
Kou... you're not respectable?

00:13:12.190 --> 00:13:15.660
At the very least, I don't have 
a problem doing things half-baked.

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:19.860
<i>The familiar nape of the neck...</i>

00:13:23.910 --> 00:13:27.740
<i>But the things he's saying... 
like a stranger...</i>

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:30.450
I don't mind being like this.

00:13:32.260 --> 00:13:36.690
<i>I feel like I want to cry.</i>

00:13:38.470 --> 00:13:41.870
<i>How did he become such a stranger to me?</i>

00:13:42.480 --> 00:13:44.110
<i>I want to know...</i>

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:49.850
<i>I want to know everything that happened 
to Kou in the three years I didn't see him.</i>

00:13:52.160 --> 00:13:53.130
<i>I want to know.</i>

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:58.540
<i>How have those things affected Kou?</i>

00:14:01.310 --> 00:14:02.390
What are you doing?

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:06.350
I-It was an impulse.

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:18.500
Listen...

00:14:19.520 --> 00:14:20.980
Do you...

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:23.960
...love me?

00:14:39.430 --> 00:14:45.080
<i>Kou... does wanting to know more 
about him mean that I love him?</i>

00:14:45.840 --> 00:14:50.480
<i>But Kou as he is now...
 I don't know...</i>

00:14:52.350 --> 00:14:54.690
I-Is that something you ask about yourself?!

00:14:54.690 --> 00:14:55.830
You're awfully sure of yourself!

00:14:56.480 --> 00:15:01.490
You idiot! It's because you started 
nuzzling up against my hair!

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:05.750
I don't feel that way about you, you know.

00:15:06.200 --> 00:15:09.440
I thought maybe I did something 
to give you the wrong impression.

00:15:09.870 --> 00:15:11.720
So I was just checking.

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:16.460
I feel the same way! I don't 
love you at all anymore, Kou.

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:18.970
It's just...

00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:23.020
I knew you back then,

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:26.780
so I'm curious about how you're 
different now, I guess.

00:15:27.830 --> 00:15:29.920
I guess... the girl I was 
back then can't accept it...

00:15:29.920 --> 00:15:31.970
You've changed, too, you know.

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:38.660
Stop searching for the old me. 
It's seriously annoying.

00:15:43.060 --> 00:15:47.660
That is, you're pretending to move forward,

00:15:47.660 --> 00:15:49.460
but you're just clinging to the past.

00:15:50.110 --> 00:15:51.880
You're so incompetent.

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:57.680
<i>Wh-What was that?</i>

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:03.650
<i>I knew it... Kou as he is now...</i>

00:16:04.180 --> 00:16:06.420
<i>I don't love him at all!</i>

00:16:17.980 --> 00:16:18.750
Hm?

00:16:18.750 --> 00:16:19.490
Hmph!

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:22.460
So stupid.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:25.400
What's wrong? You fighting?

00:16:25.400 --> 00:16:26.170
No!

00:16:27.490 --> 00:16:30.380
Fighting? You're like 
boyfriend and girlfriend!

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:32.260
Who'd date that idiot?

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:36.200
I can't tell if you're getting along or not.

00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:36.720
Right?

00:16:41.240 --> 00:16:43.140
I'm going to clean over there.

00:16:43.510 --> 00:16:44.810
What was with that?

00:16:44.810 --> 00:16:46.300
I think she hates you.

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:49.610
So you guys really are close friends, right?

00:16:53.650 --> 00:16:57.530
<i>My cupcake... he will pay.</i>

00:16:54.920 --> 00:16:57.980
<b>RAGE</b>

00:16:57.530 --> 00:16:59.050
I'm fine here.

00:17:03.230 --> 00:17:06.460
Murao, you should clean with the others.

00:17:07.240 --> 00:17:09.130
They have plenty of people.

00:17:10.390 --> 00:17:11.920
I'll help you.

00:17:13.950 --> 00:17:17.140
Murao, you have to join the others.

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:20.480
If you want to say you're fine 
by yourself, at least do it

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:24.140
after you've put in effort to 
make a place where you belong.

00:17:25.070 --> 00:17:27.060
I am making that effort.

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:38.000
Murao. I'm a teacher.

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:42.270
As long as you're a student, 
I'll never be that far away.

00:17:42.270 --> 00:17:45.410
But we can't get any 
closer than this, either.

00:17:47.550 --> 00:17:49.490
That's what I've always said, remember?

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:56.550
Murao.

00:17:59.280 --> 00:18:01.490
Go and join the others.

00:18:22.720 --> 00:18:23.870
Um...

00:18:33.740 --> 00:18:35.000
Stupid Kou!

00:18:37.150 --> 00:18:39.710
<i>How does he manage to make me so angry?</i>

00:18:40.860 --> 00:18:42.850
You're so incompetent.

00:18:44.800 --> 00:18:48.190
<i>That's right. Because he was right.</i>

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:54.300
<i>He was, but the reason I'm working 
hard now is to change that.</i>

00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:57.580
<i>So, all I have to do is
 keep working hard!</i>

00:18:57.580 --> 00:19:00.790
<i>Okay! I've got to make up with Kou!</i>

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:07.580
Ah! Kou!

00:19:14.890 --> 00:19:17.930
Um... well...

00:19:14.890 --> 00:19:17.930
<i>Is that a love confession?</i>

00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:20.430
<i>It's a love confession!</i>

00:19:22.990 --> 00:19:26.130
<i>What's with him? 
He calls me incompetent,</i>

00:19:26.130 --> 00:19:30.190
<i>but there he is, grinning over a 
girl confessing her feelings to him!</i>

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:30.940
What?

00:19:34.880 --> 00:19:36.600
S-S-Sorry!

00:19:36.600 --> 00:19:37.590
You a second-year girl?

00:19:37.590 --> 00:19:39.250
That was really forward!

00:19:39.250 --> 00:19:40.770
Uh... no...

00:19:40.770 --> 00:19:41.440
You're cute.

00:19:41.440 --> 00:19:42.950
<i>Oh, no! Third-years!</i>

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:45.150
Hey, you confessing to me?

00:19:45.150 --> 00:19:45.680
Huh?!

00:19:45.680 --> 00:19:47.120
She's confessing to me, right?

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:49.170
Idiot! It ain't you!

00:19:49.170 --> 00:19:50.700
It ain't you, either!

00:19:50.610 --> 00:19:53.120
Um... actually...

00:19:50.700 --> 00:19:52.140
Then who is it?

00:19:52.140 --> 00:19:53.120
It's me!

00:19:53.120 --> 00:19:53.790
No, me!

00:19:57.690 --> 00:20:02.130
I'm sorry. She's my girlfriend.

00:20:04.090 --> 00:20:06.380
Oh... no...

00:20:06.380 --> 00:20:09.010
We weren't after her or anything.

00:20:09.010 --> 00:20:11.310
Really? Bye, then.

00:20:17.850 --> 00:20:19.480
What were you doing, idiot?

00:20:19.790 --> 00:20:22.950
It was... a chain of events...

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:24.960
What sort of events?

00:20:25.540 --> 00:20:26.810
But Kou, you...

00:20:26.810 --> 00:20:28.750
What did I do?

00:20:30.450 --> 00:20:34.220
Sorry. It was a groundless protest.

00:20:46.190 --> 00:20:49.720
By the way, how long are 
you gonna hold my hand?

00:20:50.240 --> 00:20:54.190
A little while longer. 
Try to bear with it.

00:20:55.030 --> 00:20:58.150
I... don't mind, actually...

00:20:59.120 --> 00:21:04.220
I just thought if anyone saw you, 
it might make trouble for you...

00:21:05.270 --> 00:21:10.200
Because... if your girlfriend... 
or something... saw it...

00:21:12.480 --> 00:21:14.410
She might get the wrong idea or something...

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:19.750
It's fine. I'm not dating anyone.

00:21:21.520 --> 00:21:24.810
Oh, I see. Hmm...

00:21:24.810 --> 00:21:26.810
That's fine then, I guess.

00:21:32.220 --> 00:21:34.990
<i>Hmm... I see.</i>

00:21:36.700 --> 00:21:39.400
<i>I feel relieved somehow.</i>

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:41.310
<i>Huh?</i>

00:21:41.310 --> 00:21:46.270
<i>Even one word from Kou can 
make me feel annoyed, or relieved...</i>

00:21:47.630 --> 00:21:54.160
<i>That doesn't mean I love 
this new Kou, though...</i>

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:40.980
Next Episode . . .

00:23:29.570 --> 00:23:31.230
Let's get out and go!

00:23:31.230 --> 00:23:32.700
Yo, yo, yo!

00:23:32.700 --> 00:23:36.060
Super orienteering!

00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:40.980
We're gonna score 
a lot of them points!
